license: MIT
abstract: "Analysis pipeline testing whether regime shifts reported in the Pantanal hydrological literature can be distinguished from long-range dependence, using 126 years (1900-2025) of daily Paraguay River stage data at Ladario, Brazil: change-point detection, Hurst-exponent estimation, Monte Carlo experiments, and a neural-network anomaly detector."
keywords:
  - hydrology
  - Pantanal
  - Hurst exponent
  - long-range dependence
  - change-point detection
  - time series
